invalid type: string "00:07:48.000 --> 00:08:05.000\r\n\r\nYuvraj: The final objective is to allow users to ask questions about any meeting and receive grounded answers based on transcript content.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:20.000\r\n\r\nSarthak: That completes the project status review meeting.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:30.000\r\n\r\nSoni: Thank you everyone.", expected ÿÿ